%% MCP defense flow. Explained in: docs/components/MCP_Gateway.md
flowchart TD
    REG[register MCP server] --> DISC[discover tools]
    DISC --> HASH[mcp-manifest-1 hash - order independent]
    HASH --> PIN[(pin + snapshot)]
    CALL[agent MCP call] --> KNOWN{server+tool registered?}
    KNOWN -->|no| DENY[deny]
    KNOWN -->|yes| POLICY[Cedar + trust + manifest pin]
    REDISC[re-discovery] --> CMP{hash changed?}
    CMP -->|yes| CLS[classify drift:<br/>added/removed=high, modified=medium,<br/>metadata=low]
    CLS --> ALERT[mcp_manifest_drift alert]
